OL,3,GNEWSAPlane makes emergency landing
OL,4,Aafter bird strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger plane was forced to make an
OL,7,Femergency landing after it was struck
OL,8,Fby a bird.
OL,10,FFlight EZY213 departed Bristol Airport
OL,11,Ffor Edinburgh at approximately 09:24
OL,12,FGMT, but returned to the airport
OL,13,Fshortly after 10:00 due to suffering a
OL,14,Fbird strike during take-off.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for EasyJet said nobody
OL,17,Fwas hurt in the incident and the plane
OL,18,Flanded back in Bristol safely, adding
OL,19,Fthe aircraft was met by the emergency
OL,20,Fservices as a precaution in line with
OL,21,Fstandard procedures.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
