OL,3,GNEWSAPlane makes emergency landing
OL,4,Aafter bird strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe spokesperson also said: "While this
OL,7,Fwas outside of our control, we would
OL,8,Flike to apologise for the inconvenience
OL,9,Fcaused and we have arranged for a
OL,10,Freplacement aircraft to continue the
OL,11,Fflight to Edinburgh this morning."
